{"pageid":4666,"title":"Lightning Shrine","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lightning Shrine</span>","revid":20442,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Lightning Shrine</b> is a crafting location behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> added in <span class=\"new\" title=\"Secret Update 1.95.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2VjcmV0X1VwZGF0ZV8xLjk1LjA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Secret Update 1.95.0</span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This location is mainly used for crafting the <a href=\"/wiki/Lightningbane\" title=\"Lightningbane\">Lightningbane</a> pickaxe.\n</p><p>To access this location, you will need the <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Copper Axe</a>, and then you will need to approach the far obelisk during a thunderstorm while holding it. Once you are struck by lightning and the obelisk receives electricity, you will need to repeat this process with the remaining obelisks to unlock the passage.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5d/LightningShrineLocation.png/revision/latest?cb=20251108233012\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A view of Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"139\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"LightningShrineLocation.png\" data-image-key=\"LightningShrineLocation.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5d/LightningShrineLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251108233012\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5d/LightningShrineLocation.png/revision/latest?cb=20251108233012\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A view of Alan&#039;s AutoLogistics, with the shrine circled in the back.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5d/LightningShrineLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251108233012\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"139\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"LightningShrineLocation.png\" data-image-key=\"LightningShrineLocation.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5d/LightningShrineLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251108233012\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:LightningShrineLocation.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A view of <b>Alan's AutoLogistics</b>, with the shrine circled in the back.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Lightning Shrine</b> can be found a short distance behind <b>Alan's AutoLogistics</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Some have reported that the shrine would not open despite all rods being activated. While this isn't explicitly confirmed, it's likely that it can only be opened once per server, making a singleplayer server recommended.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0d6d5e995330c40de17951751675ef2e\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\"